{"title": "Scourge of Pests", "pageid": 27946, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Scourge_of_Pests", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Scourge of Pests</b> is a passive feature found on the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Exterminator%27s_Axe\" title=\"Exterminator's Axe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Exterminator%27s_Axe\" title=\"Exterminator's Axe\">Exterminator's Axe</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fire\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Fire_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/84/Fire_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Fire\" title=\"Fire\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-fire\">Fire</span></a> damage to <a href=\"/wiki/Plant\" title=\"Plant\">Plants</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Myconid\" title=\"Myconid\">Myconids</a><sup><i>[<a class=\"mw-selflink-fragment\" href=\"#Bugs\">See: Bugs</a>]</i></sup>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Small\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Small\">Small</a> creatures. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Exterminator%27s_Axe\" title=\"Exterminator's Axe\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Greataxe_PlusOne_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Exterminator%27s_Axe\" title=\"Exterminator's Axe\">Exterminator's Axe</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gekh_Coal\" title=\"Gekh Coal\">Gekh Coal</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The in-game tooltip for Scourge of Pests says it grants bonus damage against insects, but instead it grants bonus damage against Myconids instead.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714232140\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.041 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.046 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1483/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 12622/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4420/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 130/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.008/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 826787/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   41.231      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   41.231      1 -total\n 43.28%   17.846      1 Template:PageSeo\n 42.58%   17.555      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 41.68%   17.186      2 Template:Item_icon\n 32.40%   13.358      1 Template:RarityItem\n 25.04%   10.326      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 19.08%    7.866      5 Template:Ifempty\n 16.78%    6.919      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 14.56%    6.002      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:27946-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714232140 and revision id 371454. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}